      S0 -->|"12 held-out"| S_SEAL
      S0 -->|"131 open"| S1
      S1 -->|"752 unique DOIs"| S2
      S2 -->|"771 JSONs"| S3
      S3 -->|"Retry fails"| S2
      S3 -->|"Quote check OK"| S5
      S3 -->|"10% sample"| S4
      S4 -->|"Repairs"| S3
      S5 -->|"4 test cases"| S6
